  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let the mean and the variance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math> observations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>20</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math>, respectively. For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, if the mean of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>178</mn></math>, then the square of the maximum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is equal to ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>Mean of observation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math>,</p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8721;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Also variance is given as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>15</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8721;</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>234</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4680</mn></math></p><p>Given mean of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>178</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>178</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8721;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3560</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8721;</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8721;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8721;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3560</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4680</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>600</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3560</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn></math></p><p>Square of maximum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
